   "source": [
    "# None\n",
    "\n",
    "`None` is the sole instance of `NoneType` and commonly represents the absence of a value. Assignment to it is a syntax error; test for it with `is`."
   ],
   "id": "fa4f4e42c1bde8c6"
  },
  {
   "metadata": {},
   "cell_type": "code",
   "outputs": [],
   "execution_count": null,
   "source": [
    "value = None\n",
    "value is None  # True"
   ],
   "id": "20ad2ef849592223"
